sequenceDiagram
    participant K as kernel (drm, udev)
    participant UI as compositor UI (hotplug_controller, output_policy, wire)
    participant W as worker
    participant RT as render thread
    participant C as clients

    K->>UI: uevent change HOTPLUG=1 [CONNECTOR=id] (udev netlink, BPF-filtered to drm)
    UI->>UI: drain: fold the burst into one batch (hints deduplicated)
    alt VT away
        UI->>UI: owed to the resume (only the master's probe is forced)
    else a probe in flight
        UI->>UI: merged into the next probe
    else
        UI->>W: probe(hint)
        W->>K: drmModeGetConnector (forced probe: modes, EDID, link-status, suggested X/Y)
        W-->>UI: event_loop::post: scan ready
    end
    UI->>UI: diff_scan: removed, changed, added (identical: nothing at all)
    opt removed
        UI->>UI: evacuate windows (home kept), layer surfaces closed, pointer re-clamped
        UI->>C: wl_surface.leave, then wl_registry.global_remove (destroyed 5 s later)
        UI->>RT: output_op retire (UI has let go of the pipeline)
        RT->>K: after the last flip: CRTC off, connector unrouted, planes detached
        RT-->>UI: retired: pipeline destroyed on UI, slot free again
    end
    opt changed: new preferred mode (VM window resize)
        UI->>RT: output_op test_mode (candidates)
        RT->>K: TEST_ONLY with a real framebuffer of the new size (staged)
        RT-->>UI: tested ok (mode i)
        UI->>RT: output_op switch_mode (from frame F)
        UI->>C: wl_output.mode/geometry, xdg_output size, done; layers, maximized windows re-fit
        UI->>RT: frame F published at the new size
        RT->>RT: take the staged targets, composite F
        RT->>K: ALLOW_MODESET with frame F (old targets kept until its flip)
    end
    opt added
        UI->>RT: output_op add (connector, candidate modes)
        RT->>K: targets, free CRTC + planes (assign_crtcs), TEST_ONLY
        RT-->>UI: added (pipeline, mode i)
        UI->>C: wl_registry.global wl_output; others' new positions; windows whose home it is return
        UI->>RT: first frame published
        RT->>K: ALLOW_MODESET of the new pipeline with its first frame
    end
